# PC card pc-melee-curve pilot (BENCH-216): cv against an aa baseline battle for battle on the 46 census fields x 2 seeds (3326-3327, after the card's 3320-3325), 184 battles, about 22% of the card. tools/melee_pilot.py --share-only stops the card unless Hadur's score share is up. Template: mcprep writes work/melee-curve-pilot.args with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml and @C@ = the machine's melee width.
--suite
melee-census-317.txt
--seeds
2
--seed-base
3325
--rounds
35
--parallel
@C@
--child-heap
2G
--cpu-constant
auto
--robot-jar
bisect/hadur117.Hadur_@V@cv.jar
--robot
hadur117.Hadur @V@cv
--baseline
bisect/hadur117.Hadur_@V@aa.jar
--baseline-robot
hadur117.Hadur @V@aa
--out
work/melee-curve-@V@-pilot
--report
../docs/bench/local/melee-curve-pilot-battles.md
